<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="happy-hero"><div><span class="kicker">HAPPY TAILS</span><h1>The best chapter comes after “adopted.”</h1><p>Real little stories from PawPath animals who found safety, routines, favourite toys and people to call their own.</p></div><div class="happy-hero-paws" aria-hidden="true">🐾 ♡ 🐾</div></section>
<section class="section happy-stories"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="kicker">LIFE AFTER ADOPTION</span><h2>Home looks good on them</h2></div></div><div class="happy-grid"><% stories.forEach((story,index) => { %><article class="happy-card"><div class="happy-photo"><img src="<%= story.after_photo_url %>" alt="<%= story.dog_name %> after adoption"><span><%= index % 2 ? 'HOME SWEET HOME' : 'HAPPILY ADOPTED' %></span></div><div><small>HAPPY TAIL #<%= String(story.id).padStart(2,'0') %></small><h2><%= story.title %></h2><h3><%= story.dog_name %></h3><p><%= story.story_text %></p><footer>Shared by <strong><%= story.username || 'a PawPath family' %></strong> · <%= new Date(story.created_at).toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{month:'long',year:'numeric'}) %></footer></div></article><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section share-tail"><div><span class="kicker">YOUR TURN</span><h2>Share your after-adoption story</h2><p>If your offer was accepted, add a recent picture and tell everyone how your new family member is doing.</p></div><% if (!currentUser) { %><a class="button" href="/login">Log in to share a story</a><% } else if (!adoptedAnimals.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><p>Your accepted adoptions will appear here when they are ready for a Happy Tale.</p></div><% } else { %><form method="post" action="/happy-tails" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="happy-form"><% if (errors.length) { %><div class="form-errors"><ul><% errors.forEach(error => { %><li><%= error %></li><% }) %></ul></div><% } %><label>Adopted animal<select name="animal_id" required><option value="">Choose</option><% adoptedAnimals.forEach(animal => { %><option value="<%= animal.id %>"><%= animal.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Story title<input name="title" required minlength="5" placeholder="e.g. From street naps to sofa naps"></label><label>What is life like now?<textarea name="story_text" required minlength="40" rows="5" placeholder="Favourite toy, first walk, funny habit, new best friend..."></textarea></label><label>Recent photo after adoption<input type="file" name="after_photo" accept="image/*" required></label><button class="button">Publish our Happy Tale ♡</button></form><% } %></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
